New feature:
Create a space where members can create their own video content channel, specifying free, pay-per-view or channel subscription. Guests and members are able to view all free content. Guests and members are also able to view pay/subscribe to members' content. Content will also be featured at the top based on views, favorites, popularity, recency, etc. Creators can also link their youtube, tiktok and instagram content (videos, shorts, reels or full youtube channel) to one of their app channels for full integration. These linked content cannot be marked as pay-per-view or require a paid subscription. Viewing and subscription is free. Only members (free or subscription) can subscribe, like or comment on video content. Only directly uploaded or directly recorded content may be monetized.

