Guest subscriptions: You said guests can purchase subscriptions, but also that only members can subscribe. I recommend distinguishing:
Follow: Free, registered members only.
Paid channel subscription: Requires at least a free registered account.
Pay-per-view: Guests may purchase through secure checkout, with a receipt/access-restoration method.
Creator revenue: What percentage should creators receive? The existing 80% of net bot sales and 25% membership referral commission will not automatically apply to video sales.

Video pricing, purchase-access duration and hosting limits also need defining. Unlimited bot-file operations will remain separate from video storage and streaming allowances.

